Lean Init source attribution inventory
======================================

Source: https://github.com/leanprover/lean4
Revision: 6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d (v4.34.0-rc2)
License: Apache-2.0; see lean4-LICENSE and lean4-LICENSES.

This inventory preserves the leading attribution/license comments from every
Init Lean source file at the pinned revision. It covers the source corpus from
which the canonical primitive template dependency closure was exported, not
only the smaller subset referenced by the resulting templates. File paths below
are relative to the pinned Lean repository. Comments are reproduced verbatim.

The exported expression data is adapted for SandScript by DevBlanket AB, 2026:
selected declaration dependency closures are encoded as immutable WAT template
data for structural authentication, without running native Lean code.

